{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27902","headline":"韩协律相送精舍读书四韵奉寄呈陆补阙 · 朱庆余","name":"韩协律相送精舍读书四韵奉寄呈陆补阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白鹤西山别，更看上去船。\n遥知寻寺路，应念宿江烟。\n到处无闲日，回期已隔年。\n何因陪夜坐，清论谏臣边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}